## Summary

Turning gridlines off leaves them visible on box-and-whisker and stock charts. Both chart kinds have the documented gridlines on/off option, and the renderer used by the application produces the same chart drawing in both states. This affects chart appearance, including a valid four-series open-high-low-close stock chart.

## Steps to reproduce

